WEBVTT

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:36.900 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:39.960 line:0%
[Episode 13]

00:01:41.559 --> 00:01:42.960 line:0%
In Chen Shoujie's mansion,

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:43.600 line:0%
only a piece of fabric

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:45.600 line:0%
from the Jinxiu Workshop was found.

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:47.240 line:0%
But I need to check and see

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:49.210 line:0%
in which year the pattern on it was made.

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:50.250 line:0%
Not my concern.

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:51.210 line:0%
Very well.

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:52.400 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:54.580 line:0%
Yes, Grand Commander.

00:01:54.730 --> 00:01:56.200 line:0%
I will immediately take this mad woman

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:58.779 line:0%
to the eighteenth floor of the prison of our Imperial Security Bureau.

00:01:58.779 --> 00:02:02.510 line:0%
I'm not asking you to take her back to the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:05.810 line:0%
You take Miss Yun Que

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:08.960 line:0%
to Shen's Mansion and let her stay there.

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:17.950 line:0%
Miss Yun Que.

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:19.200 line:0%
Please.

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:35.580 line:0%
[Yan's Mansion]

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:37.560 line:0%
Miss.

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:39.960 line:0%
A maid from Shen's Mansion wants to see you.

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:42.140 line:0%
Xiaohe.

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:42.960 line:0%
Madam.

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:44.320 line:0%
Please go back to the mansion quickly.

00:02:44.320 --> 00:02:45.640 line:0%
This morning, after Grand Commander left,

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:47.240 line:0%
Yun Que became a totally different person.

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:50.900 line:0%
If you don't discipline her right now, things will get out of hand.

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:53.800 line:0%
Move this porcelain vase

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:54.480 line:0%
there.

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:54.960 line:0%
Wipe it clean.

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:56.290 line:0%
The lantern in front...

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:58.160 line:0%
Madam, look at her.

00:02:58.160 --> 00:02:58.960 line:0%
She has been bossing around

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:00.680 line:0%
the people in our mansion.

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:02.750 line:0%
She even mistook Grand Commander.

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:03.880 line:0%
Grand Commander took pity on her

00:03:03.880 --> 00:03:04.980 line:0%
and kindly took her in.

00:03:04.980 --> 00:03:05.980 line:0%
But she...

00:03:06.010 --> 00:03:07.400 line:0%
She's acting like she's the mistress of the house.

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:07.880 line:0%
We'd better use things

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:10.080 line:0%
that match Grand Commander's Mansion.

00:03:10.360 --> 00:03:12.240 line:0%
You all should go out and see more of the world.

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:13.640 line:0%
That way, when you go out and get cushions,

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:14.880 line:0%
you'll know what the best option is.

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:17.260 line:0%
Have you weeded the backyard?

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:19.440 line:0%
Have you dusted the bookshelves

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:21.320 line:0%
as Grand Commander asked you to?

00:03:21.879 --> 00:03:23.670 line:0%
If not, hurry up and do it.

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:30.000 line:0%
I was instructing them to decorate the front hall.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.200 line:0%
Doesn't that count as important work?

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:32.400 line:0%
Miss Yun Que.

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:34.400 line:0%
Don't say that.

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:36.280 line:0%
You misunderstood.

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:37.800 line:0%
You can give the servants orders

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:39.280 line:0%
and they should do their jobs well.

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:40.000 line:0%
However,

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:43.160 line:0%
we're paid by the Shen family.

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:45.040 line:0%
We work for Grand Commander.

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:45.920 line:0%
So first and foremost,

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:47.879 line:0%
the tasks assigned by Grand Commander

00:03:47.879 --> 00:03:50.200 line:0%
should be our priorities.

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:52.020 line:0%
It's understandable, right?

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:55.560 line:0%
Then I'll discuss the decorations tomorrow.

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:56.320 line:0%
Mr. Shen.

00:03:56.320 --> 00:03:57.520 line:0%
Arrange all the ledgers in the mansion

00:03:57.520 --> 00:03:58.950 line:0%
and get them to me.

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:00.200 line:0%
I'd like to take a look at them.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:01.400 line:0%
I'm sorry, Miss.

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:03.640 line:0%
The ledgers in the Shen family

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:06.880 line:0%
can only be reviewed by the mistress of the house.

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:10.280 line:0%
Madam.

00:04:10.570 --> 00:04:12.220 line:0%
Good morning.

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:17.139 line:0%
Mr. Shen.

00:04:17.319 --> 00:04:18.360 line:0%
Why today...

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:19.290 line:0%
Madam.

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:21.389 line:0%
I forgot to greet you this morning.

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:23.000 line:0%
Let me apologize to you.

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:24.510 line:0%
Please punish me for it, Madam.

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:25.500 line:0%
Punish you?

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:27.960 line:0%
According to the rules of the Shen family,

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:29.280 line:0%
all servants in Shen's Mansion

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:32.800 line:0%
must greet the Madam in the morning and the evening.

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:35.910 line:0%
The women in the mansion must also

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:37.590 line:0%
bow and offer tea to the Madam.

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:39.950 line:0%
Since the first day I came to the mansion,

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:41.560 line:0%
I've kept this firmly in mind.

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:45.220 line:0%
Shen's Mansion doesn't welcome those without good manners.

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:47.720 line:0%
Today, I was being disrespectful to you.

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:49.250 line:0%
Even if you are to

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:50.640 line:0%
expel me from the mansion,

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:53.280 line:0%
it will be entirely justified.

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:55.620 line:0%
Alright, alright.

00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:56.880 line:0%
I know what you mean.

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:57.600 line:0%
You just want me

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:59.200 line:0%
to offer tea to Mrs. Shen, right?

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:01.000 line:0%
I'll do it then.

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:01.920 line:0%
Madam.

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:03.680 line:0%
Please have some tea.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:19.360 line:0%
Madam.

00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:21.450 line:0%
Now I've offered you the tea.

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:23.440 line:0%
And you've let me know the rules.

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:25.460 line:0%
Let's get things straight.

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:26.520 line:0%
It was Grand Commander

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:28.200 line:0%
who asked me to manage the household affairs.

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:30.280 line:0%
Of course I should try my best.

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:31.510 line:0%
Madam.

00:05:31.959 --> 00:05:33.160 line:0%
Are you going to

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:34.760 line:0%
go against Grand Commander?

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:37.840 line:0%
Miss Yun Que, you just said

00:05:37.959 --> 00:05:40.020 line:0%
you wanted to see the ledgers, right?

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:41.000 line:0%
Yes.

00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:42.560 line:0%
Since you want to see them,

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:43.480 line:0%
why don't you

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:45.880 line:0%
manage all the ledgers for the next season?

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:47.440 line:0%
This...

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:49.560 line:0%
Madam.

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:50.990 line:0%
You mean

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:53.930 line:0%
you're going to let me handle all the ledgers?

00:05:54.959 --> 00:05:56.320 line:0%
I'm not good at

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:57.680 line:0%
dealing with the accounts.

00:05:57.680 --> 00:05:59.800 line:0%
Miss Yun Que, since you want to help me with it,

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:01.040 line:0%
that's perfect.

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:02.120 line:0%
Madam.

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:03.000 line:0%
Mr. Shen.

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:05.150 line:0%
Please bring the ledgers and give them

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:06.360 line:0%
to Miss Yun Que.

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:08.840 line:0%
I've been on an errand recently.

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:10.600 line:0%
Let Miss Yun Que

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:13.000 line:0%
take care of all the affairs in the mansion.

00:06:14.070 --> 00:06:15.080 line:0%
Miss Yun Que.

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:16.280 line:0%
Thank you.

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:18.520 line:0%
Madam.

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:20.200 line:0%
Please think carefully.

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:22.510 line:0%
Sir made a mistake.

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:24.560 line:0%
He must have been

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:26.190 line:0%
bewitched by that girl.

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:28.460 line:0%
She must have used some dirty tricks

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:30.560 line:0%
to trick Sir into bringing her home.

00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:31.560 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:06:31.959 --> 00:06:33.840 line:0%
In his heart, you're always

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:35.000 line:0%
his one and only wife.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:36.160 line:0%
Moreover, all of us

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:37.600 line:0%
are on your side.

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:38.880 line:0%
Butler Shen.

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:39.920 line:0%
It really has nothing to do

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:41.040 line:0%
with Miss Yun Que.

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:43.140 line:0%
Madam.

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:47.000 line:0%
I'm not stupid.

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:49.120 line:0%
If you are not angry with her,

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:50.040 line:0%
why are you

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:52.200 line:0%
moving back to your parents' home?

00:06:52.230 --> 00:06:54.690 line:0%
Who said I'm moving back to my parents' home?

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:58.000 line:0%
I've been busy investigating cases recently.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:06:58.840 line:0%
So I'm afraid I'll have to stay at the Ministry of Justice

00:06:58.840 --> 00:06:59.560 line:0%
and work late every day.

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:01.080 line:0%
So I won't come back to sleep in the following days.

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:02.000 line:0%
No need to worry about me.

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:02.680 line:0%
Bye.

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:09.500 line:0%
W-W-What should I do now?

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:19.240 line:0%
Just say what you have to say.

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:22.270 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:24.100 line:0%
In recent days when you've not been in your mansion,

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:25.180 line:0%
Miss Yun Que

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:26.560 line:0%
did things such as getting new porcelain plates,

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:27.920 line:0%
buying new embroidered cloths and so on every day.

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:30.040 line:0%
Uncle Zhong argued with her every day.

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:31.840 line:0%
Today, he even gave me an order,

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:32.920 line:0%
saying if I don't bring

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:34.709 line:0%
you and your wife back,

00:07:35.540 --> 00:07:37.870 line:0%
he won't allow me to return to the mansion.

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:43.660 line:0%
Since when

00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:48.550 line:0%
did Mr. Zhong start to like Yan Xing?

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:54.470 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:56.430 line:0%
Can you just tell me the truth?

00:07:56.709 --> 00:07:58.740 line:0%
At first, I thought you were into

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:01.050 line:0%
Miss Yun Que.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:02.780 line:0%
However, since

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:04.470 line:0%
you brought her back to the mansion,

00:08:04.470 --> 00:08:06.330 line:0%
you haven't returned home at all.

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:07.800 line:0%
I...

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:10.440 line:0%
Whose side should I take?

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:14.210 line:0%
Guard Jing, it seems you're not busy at all.

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:15.280 line:0%
You even have time

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:17.280 line:0%
to worry about my personal affairs.

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:19.440 line:0%
I'm sorry.

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:23.310 line:0%
Get up.

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:29.210 line:0%
How are the security arrangements

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:30.740 line:0%
for the upcoming days?

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:32.589 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:34.160 line:0%
Everything is ready.

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:35.680 line:0%
The security of the Palace Library

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:36.469 line:0%
is now the responsibility

00:08:36.469 --> 00:08:37.680 line:0%
of Imperial Security Bureau.

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:38.680 line:0%
The original guards

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:39.680 line:0%
have been reassigned to support

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:41.880 line:0%
the constables at the Hongwen Academy.

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:51.720 line:0%
Jiang Langxing is there.

00:08:51.720 --> 00:08:52.320 line:0%
That's perfect.

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:53.960 line:0%
Let's quickly finish talking and go home.

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:54.230 line:0%
[Hongwen Academy]

00:08:54.520 --> 00:08:55.450 line:0%
Jiang Langxing.

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:57.920 line:0%
Examinees are not allowed to talk to each other.

00:08:57.920 --> 00:08:59.160 line:0%
Commander Xu asked us to bring a message for you.

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:00.040 line:0%
Listen.

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:00.920 line:0%
The higher-ups

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:02.560 line:0%
emphasized repeatedly that the exam is of great importance.

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:04.000 line:0%
This time, the exam halls

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:05.400 line:0%
must be so tightly watched that even a fly cannot get in

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:06.560 line:0%
and that even one page of reference books cannot be brought in.

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:07.440 line:0%
Understand?

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:16.400 line:0%
Y-Y-You were speaking too fast.

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:17.600 line:0%
I didn't follow.

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:19.520 line:0%
Chuichui, Chuichui.

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:21.320 line:0%
You can speak a little slower.

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:22.160 line:0%
Besides,

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:23.960 line:0%
Commander Xu also asked us

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:25.920 line:0%
to go around and inspect

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:26.520 line:0%
the security work

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:27.920 line:0%
to see if there's anything wrong.

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:29.580 line:0%
We need to inspect their work?

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:33.120 line:0%
Ladies.

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:34.560 line:0%
How about you come in with me to take a look?

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:35.480 line:0%
There are several doors inside,

00:09:35.480 --> 00:09:37.990 line:0%
and we've set up checkpoints in the inner courtyard as well.

00:09:37.990 --> 00:09:39.030 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:09:39.480 --> 00:09:41.920 line:0%
Why don't you two go in first?

00:09:41.920 --> 00:09:43.120 line:0%
I'll wait here for Mojie

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:44.580 line:0%
and see when he'll arrive.

00:09:44.760 --> 00:09:45.560 line:0%
Oh, right.

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:48.560 line:0%
Your fifth brother also passed the preliminary exam.

00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:49.600 line:0%
Alright.

00:09:49.640 --> 00:09:50.970 line:0%
-Go.
-I’m going in then.

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:56.120 line:0%
Jiang Guban.

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:57.040 line:0%
Hurry up.

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:03.880 line:0%
It's not easy to be a matchmaker.

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:06.040 line:0%
Excuse me.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:06.680 line:0%
Could you

00:10:06.680 --> 00:10:08.200 line:0%
help me find someone?

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:11.780 line:0%
Pan Chi.

00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:12.470 line:0%
[Ruan Jinping] [Jiang Han] [Ji Daozhang]

00:10:12.470 --> 00:10:16.100 line:0%
[Pan Chi] [Ji Jiashun] [Jiangxia County]

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:16.480 line:0%
The person you're looking for

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:18.320 line:0%
is indeed on the list of the final examinees.

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:19.360 line:0%
But up until now,

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:21.820 line:0%
he hasn't registered for the final exam yet.

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:42.500 line:0%
[Hongwen Hall]

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:44.680 line:0%
Pan.

00:10:45.640 --> 00:10:47.120 line:0%
Did you really give up?

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:51.000 line:0%
Who said I gave up?

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:55.640 line:0%
Pan.

00:10:56.240 --> 00:10:57.120 line:0%
It's really you.

00:10:57.120 --> 00:10:58.560 line:0%
You're here to take the exam.

00:10:58.560 --> 00:10:59.360 line:0%
That day,

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:00.420 line:0%
after I sobered up,

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:02.400 line:0%
I thought about what you said to me.

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:03.520 line:0%
It's rare for the Hongwen Academy

00:11:03.520 --> 00:11:05.120 line:0%
to select candidates from everyone.

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:06.810 line:0%
I'm so talented.

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:08.480 line:0%
I must impress

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:10.120 line:0%
those pedantic old scholars.

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:11.320 line:0%
I'll let them see

00:11:11.340 --> 00:11:13.870 line:0%
what a truly exceptional piece of writing is.

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:15.120 line:0%
Congratulations.

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:17.240 line:0%
Then may you succeed in one go

00:11:17.240 --> 00:11:18.560 line:0%
and your name be on the list.

00:11:18.260 --> 00:11:22.620 line:0%
[Hongwen Hall]

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:21.410 line:0%
Your name is Pan Chi.

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:23.720 line:0%
The top folk detective's name is also Pan Chi.

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:25.360 line:0%
You must be as excellent as him.

00:11:25.360 --> 00:11:26.170 line:0%
Today,

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:27.460 line:0%
you look amazing.

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:28.580 line:0%
Of course.

00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:30.490 line:0%
With just a bit of grooming,

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:32.280 line:0%
I'll be so handsome and dashing

00:11:32.280 --> 00:11:34.070 line:0%
that I'll impress the people in Xiang'an.

00:11:34.070 --> 00:11:35.510 line:0%
Jokes aside,

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:36.920 line:0%
you don't look well.

00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:40.160 line:0%
Have you been drinking again these past few days?

00:11:40.280 --> 00:11:41.620 line:0%
Recently,

00:11:41.650 --> 00:11:44.020 line:0%
I've been busy investigating cases and reviewing files.

00:11:44.020 --> 00:11:44.820 line:0%
But

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:46.220 line:0%
I haven't found any clues.

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:50.260 line:0%
[Hongwen Hall]

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:48.310 line:0%
Is the case you're talking about

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:49.400 line:0%
the one that involves

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:50.720 line:0%
the flying moths?

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:51.970 line:0%
You heard about it?

00:11:51.970 --> 00:11:53.070 line:0%
Of course.

00:11:53.090 --> 00:11:54.320 line:0%
People in the whole city all heard of it.

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:55.690 line:0%
It's been spread around like some mystical tale.

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:56.930 line:0%
But in my opinion,

00:11:57.360 --> 00:11:59.240 line:0%
you shouldn't just read the files.

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:01.240 line:0%
You need to ask more people about it.

00:12:02.590 --> 00:12:04.590 line:0%
I've asked all the people around.

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:06.240 line:0%
As for the people involved in the case,

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:07.080 line:0%
one is dead,

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:08.140 line:0%
and the other has gone mad.

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:09.060 line:0%
So what?

00:12:09.590 --> 00:12:11.110 line:0%
People in our line of work

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:13.010 line:0%
aren't afraid of corpses at all.

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:14.580 line:0%
From the dead body,

00:12:14.610 --> 00:12:15.960 line:0%
we can get a lot of information.

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:16.880 line:0%
Moreover,

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:18.220 line:0%
what a madman says

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:20.040 line:0%
might not all be nonsense.

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:33.370 line:0%
[Lintai Pavilion]

00:13:09.740 --> 00:13:12.180 line:0%
[Please take your troops to me and cooperate with me.]

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:17.210 line:0%
[Send troops to protect the Shen family after you enter the city.]

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:17.000 line:0%
This handwriting

00:13:17.820 --> 00:13:20.620 line:0%
is my father's handwriting before he was injured.

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:24.020 line:0%
When Lord Shen was young,

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:25.870 line:0%
his brush strokes were as sharp as a sword,

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:27.400 line:0%
powerful and magnificent.

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:29.090 line:0%
But later on,

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:30.160 line:0%
his strokes

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:32.080 line:0%
got rid of the peculiarity

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:33.480 line:0%
and became simple and smooth.

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:36.180 line:0%
It took me a long time to practice

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:37.200 line:0%
before I could have

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:39.460 line:0%
such an identical handwriting.

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:41.710 line:0%
[I followed you into the palace to work with you.]

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:41.280 line:0%
So it is indeed forged.

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:43.360 line:0%
If it was Dr. Yan who knew my father's handwriting

00:13:43.360 --> 00:13:44.690 line:0%
so well that framed him,

00:13:45.280 --> 00:13:46.120 line:0%
he would certainly not have used

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:47.180 line:0%
the wrong strokes.

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:48.760 line:0%
The forger

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:50.240 line:0%
is someone else.

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:52.440 line:0%
Pan.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:53.400 line:0%
Thank you.

00:13:53.880 --> 00:13:55.480 line:0%
Thanks to your reminder,

00:13:55.840 --> 00:13:58.440 line:0%
I seem to have got new ideas.

00:13:58.480 --> 00:13:59.390 line:0%
Me?

00:14:00.280 --> 00:14:02.080 line:0%
I didn't remind you of anything.

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:03.580 line:0%
[Hongwen Hall]

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:05.850 line:0%
Honey, I've been looking for you for long.

00:14:15.840 --> 00:14:18.650 line:0%
Shouldn't you be discussing cases at the Ministry of Justice?

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:20.390 line:0%
How come you're here chatting with someone?

00:14:20.390 --> 00:14:21.410 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:23.680 line:0%
I'm here for work.

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:25.000 line:0%
You should just take care of the affairs

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:26.320 line:0%
in your Imperial Security Bureau.

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:28.200 line:0%
What I do and where I go every day

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:29.600 line:0%
is none of your business.

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:32.120 line:0%
I can't interfere with the affairs of the Ministry of Justice.

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:32.800 line:0%
But what if you don't

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:35.200 line:0%
do your job well as the mistress of my house?

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:37.040 line:0%
Our mansion is in a mess.

00:14:37.400 --> 00:14:39.330 line:0%
As the wife of the grand commander,

00:14:39.620 --> 00:14:41.680 line:0%
you should go back and take care of it.

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:43.880 line:0%
Go home.

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:53.160 line:0%
Do you expect that

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:55.520 line:0%
you'll be the grand commander's wife just like Madam

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:57.520 line:0%
and that you two can share a husband?

00:14:58.240 --> 00:14:59.480 line:0%
Let me tell you,

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:01.680 line:0%
as long as I'm alive,

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:04.290 line:0%
you'll never join the Shen family.

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:06.600 line:0%
[Noble Aspiration] [Gentle and Humble]

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:05.840 line:0%
That's not for you to decide.

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:07.000 line:0%
Let me say it again,

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:08.260 line:0%
Give me the ledgers.

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:15.040 line:0%
Grand Commander, Madam.

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:17.340 line:0%
[Noble Aspiration] [Gentle and Humble]

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:15.800 line:0%
Sir.

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:17.480 line:0%
You've brought Madam back.

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:19.040 line:0%
As the old saying goes,

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:21.890 line:0%
disagreements between a couple won't last long.

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:24.420 line:0%
This is how you'll be a loving couple forever.

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:25.490 line:0%
Mr. Shen.

00:15:25.680 --> 00:15:26.840 line:0%
I'm a bit hungry.

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:27.640 line:0%
How about you go to the kitchen

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:29.240 line:0%
and check on today's dishes?

00:15:29.600 --> 00:15:30.400 line:0%
Okay.

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:31.290 line:0%
I'll go right away.

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:33.110 line:0%
[Noble Aspiration] [Gentle and Humble]

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:37.480 line:0%
Miss Yun Que.

00:15:37.560 --> 00:15:38.960 line:0%
Stop arguing with Butler Shen.

00:15:38.960 --> 00:15:40.080 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:42.080 line:0%
The day Grand Commander and I got married,

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:43.560 line:0%
I made an agreement with the grand commander

00:15:43.560 --> 00:15:45.490 line:0%
that we would get a divorce one day.

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:48.400 line:0%
The ledgers

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:50.550 line:0%
will be handled by you sooner or later.

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:52.220 line:0%
Divorce?

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:57.440 line:0%
The grand commander is such a wonderful man.

00:15:57.440 --> 00:15:59.170 line:0%
How come you don't cherish him?

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:00.680 line:0%
Grand Commander is talented and handsome,

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:01.840 line:0%
like a tall tree in the wind.

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:03.280 line:0%
Whoever can't see this

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:05.080 line:0%
is truly blind.

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:09.960 line:0%
What a nice girl.

00:16:10.480 --> 00:16:12.680 line:0%
Unfortunately, her judgement of the grand commander is so wrong.

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:13.880 line:0%
Why are you laughing?

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:14.810 line:0%
Don't tell me

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:17.230 line:0%
you think Grand Commander is ugly.

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:18.790 line:0%
No, no, no,

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:19.830 line:0%
Miss Yun Que.

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:20.880 line:0%
You can eat wrong food,

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:21.960 line:0%
but you can't say wrong words.

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:22.680 line:0%
I think there's nothing more

00:16:22.680 --> 00:16:23.640 line:0%
for us to do here.

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:25.570 line:0%
We'd better leave quickly.

00:16:25.640 --> 00:16:26.960 line:0%
Don't drag me.

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:28.290 line:0%
Then walk yourself.

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:37.920 line:0%
Go back to the mansion and stay there.

00:16:37.920 --> 00:16:38.720 line:0%
After all,

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:39.760 line:0%
we...

00:16:39.880 --> 00:16:40.760 line:0%
I understand.

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:45.160 line:0%
I'm not the person in your heart.

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:58.040 line:0%
If outsiders find out,

00:16:58.040 --> 00:16:59.500 line:0%
it will only cause gossip.

00:17:01.320 --> 00:17:02.280 line:0%
After the case is solved,

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:03.400 line:0%
I will come back.

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:05.300 line:0%
I won't cause you any trouble.

00:17:56.850 --> 00:18:03.440 line:0%
[Hongwen Hall]

00:17:58.290 --> 00:17:59.480 line:0%
Her Majesty

00:17:59.570 --> 00:18:02.520 line:0%
has drawn the topic for the final exam.

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:05.300 line:0%
We have been ordered to open it.

00:18:05.840 --> 00:18:06.640 line:0%
The topic is

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:09.800 line:0%
"Appreciating the after-rain scenery of geese returning,

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:11.840 line:0%
Viewing the grandeur of Xiang'an"

00:18:12.340 --> 00:18:13.850 line:0%
The form of writing is not limited,

00:18:13.850 --> 00:18:15.780 line:0%
but poetry and odes are preferred.

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:23.600 line:0%
Take him away.

00:18:25.350 --> 00:18:27.280 line:0%
[Concluded]

00:18:35.060 --> 00:18:36.500 line:0%
[Test Paper of Pan Chi]

00:18:40.130 --> 00:18:41.060 line:0%
[Admission List]

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:47.120 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:18:47.360 --> 00:18:49.280 line:0%
We have been grading the papers for three days,

00:18:49.280 --> 00:18:50.600 line:0%
and have finalized the list of candidates

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:52.340 line:0%
for admission to the Hongwen Academy.

00:18:52.340 --> 00:18:54.800 line:0%
We humbly request Your Majesty to review it.

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:57.720 line:0%
The exam papers have been arranged according to their scores.

00:18:57.720 --> 00:18:59.080 line:0%
The one on the top

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:00.560 line:0%
is the work by Cheng Bojian

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:02.040 line:0%
who gets the highest score.

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:02.110 line:0%
[Test Paper of Cheng Bojian]

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:10.220 line:0%
[Test Paper of Pan Chi]

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:10.810 line:0%
Pan Chi

00:19:11.010 --> 00:19:13.130 line:0%
gets the last place?

00:19:13.160 --> 00:19:13.920 line:0%
Yes.

00:19:14.360 --> 00:19:15.160 line:0%
Wan'er.

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:18.240 line:0%
Read me the last-place examinee's

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:19.640 line:0%
essay.

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:24.990 line:0%
Tall pines grow at the foot of the mountain.

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:27.050 line:0%
Short sprouts are born on the peak.

00:19:27.320 --> 00:19:29.110 line:0%
With stems just an inch thick,

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:31.300 line:0%
they overshadow the pine branches hundred-foot tall.

00:19:31.300 --> 00:19:32.780 line:0%
I feel

00:19:32.880 --> 00:19:34.720 line:0%
the literary talent of the last-place examinee

00:19:34.720 --> 00:19:36.330 line:0%
is also quite remarkable.

00:19:36.680 --> 00:19:37.680 line:0%
Pan Chi

00:19:37.720 --> 00:19:39.800 line:0%
didn't lose because of his literary skills.

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:40.810 line:0%
Instead,

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:42.590 line:0%
his essay is a bit off-topic.

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:49.010 line:0%
I'm afraid I don't quite

00:19:49.260 --> 00:19:50.700 line:0%
understand it.

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:51.760 line:0%
Wan'er.

00:19:52.430 --> 00:19:55.830 line:0%
Please explain the essay to me.

00:19:57.220 --> 00:20:00.180 line:0%
The writer uses the tall pines

00:20:01.120 --> 00:20:02.590 line:0%
at the foot of Mount Yangui

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:05.640 line:0%
to symbolize talented scholars from humble backgrounds.

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:07.560 line:0%
The short sprouts on the mountaintop

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:10.020 line:0%
represent the offspring of noble families.

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:12.410 line:0%
Born in high positions,

00:20:12.510 --> 00:20:13.910 line:0%
these inch-tall sprouts

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:16.680 line:0%
can overshadow the pines that are hundred-foot tall.

00:20:16.680 --> 00:20:17.760 line:0%
I think

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:19.990 line:0%
the views of Mount Yangui

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:23.320 line:0%
are described wonderfully by him.

00:20:23.730 --> 00:20:24.820 line:0%
Go on.

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:27.740 line:0%
Laughing heartily to the sky,

00:20:28.000 --> 00:20:30.120 line:0%
I stride across the divine land.

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:32.950 line:0%
[Hongwen Hall]

00:20:30.360 --> 00:20:32.200 line:0%
Though the noble deem themselves precious,

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:34.120 line:0%
I see them as mere dust.

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:36.440 line:0%
Though the humble consider themselves lowly,

00:20:36.440 --> 00:20:38.940 line:0%
who's to say they're not worth a thousand gold?

00:20:38.940 --> 00:20:40.910 line:0%
I shake my robes and gaze upon the mountains,

00:20:40.910 --> 00:20:43.660 line:0%
washing my feet in the long river.

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:46.540 line:0%
I, Pan Chi, will not only take the exam

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:47.480 line:0%
but also let people know

00:20:47.480 --> 00:20:49.240 line:0%
what dirty jobs you're doing.

00:21:05.340 --> 00:21:06.900 line:0%
I can tell your attention

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:09.310 line:0%
is not focused on the chessboard.

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:15.330 line:0%
Are you wondering why I still

00:21:15.640 --> 00:21:17.680 line:0%
approved the original list even though

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:20.240 line:0%
I've told that

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:21.750 line:0%
there's corruption in Hongwen Academy's

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:23.710 line:0%
selection process?

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:26.880 line:0%
I wanted to ask that question initially.

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:28.680 line:0%
But I've just figured it out.

00:21:29.190 --> 00:21:31.920 line:0%
Although Pan Chi is talented,

00:21:32.280 --> 00:21:33.850 line:0%
he's too impulsive.

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:34.800 line:0%
Therefore,

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:37.560 line:0%
he's not suitable to be a government official.

00:21:39.210 --> 00:21:40.620 line:0%
This examination

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:43.660 line:0%
is a pilot project.

00:21:43.680 --> 00:21:45.560 line:0%
The selection of talented scholars

00:21:45.560 --> 00:21:47.320 line:0%
has long been plagued by malpractices.

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:48.520 line:0%
Many court officials

00:21:48.790 --> 00:21:51.410 line:0%
are involved in it,

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:53.560 line:0%
making the problem

00:21:53.560 --> 00:21:55.490 line:0%
extremely difficult to deal with.

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:01.390 line:0%
Though I want to deal with the problem,

00:22:01.560 --> 00:22:02.900 line:0%
I still need to see

00:22:03.200 --> 00:22:05.950 line:0%
when it's the right time to take action.

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:08.950 line:0%
"I shake my robes and gaze upon the mountains,

00:22:09.540 --> 00:22:11.540 line:0%
washing my feet in the long river.''

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:15.360 line:0%
This piece of writing is truly magnificent.

00:22:15.570 --> 00:22:17.140 line:0%
It uses scenery description to satirize the times,

00:22:17.140 --> 00:22:18.070 line:0%
suggesting that

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:18.960 line:0%
some people are sidelining

00:22:18.960 --> 00:22:20.440 line:0%
scholars from humble backgrounds

00:22:20.440 --> 00:22:21.360 line:0%
in the name of fair selection

00:22:21.360 --> 00:22:22.800 line:0%
and thus solidifying the position of noble classes.

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:23.880 line:0%
The essay is so penetrating.

00:22:23.880 --> 00:22:24.760 line:0%
Alright.

00:22:24.920 --> 00:22:26.190 line:0%
You've been praising your friend

00:22:26.190 --> 00:22:27.430 line:0%
for quite a while now.

00:22:28.070 --> 00:22:30.390 line:0%
Well, he did write exceptionally well.

00:22:30.560 --> 00:22:31.400 line:0%
Pan

00:22:31.520 --> 00:22:32.240 line:0%
not only

00:22:32.240 --> 00:22:34.440 line:0%
shares the name with the top folk detective.

00:22:34.440 --> 00:22:35.600 line:0%
It's very possible

00:22:35.630 --> 00:22:37.160 line:0%
he's the detective.

00:22:37.640 --> 00:22:39.240 line:0%
It's almost certainly true.

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:44.800 line:0%
Miss Yan.

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:51.550 line:0%
Commander Xu asked me to tell you

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:52.760 line:0%
that the investigation you requested

00:22:52.760 --> 00:22:54.000 line:0%
into Chen Shoujie's background

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:55.000 line:0%
has yielded some results.

00:22:55.000 --> 00:22:56.800 line:0%
Chen Shoujie indeed

00:22:56.800 --> 00:22:58.760 line:0%
participated in investigating the Chen Huo'e case,

00:22:58.760 --> 00:23:00.520 line:0%
and was even promoted because of it.

00:23:00.520 --> 00:23:02.280 line:0%
However, shortly after his promotion,

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:03.280 line:0%
he went insane.

00:23:04.980 --> 00:23:06.920 line:0%
So before Mrs. Chen died,

00:23:06.920 --> 00:23:08.360 line:0%
he had already gone mad.

00:23:09.440 --> 00:23:11.040 line:0%
He must have some connection

00:23:11.120 --> 00:23:12.380 line:0%
with the fire moth case

00:23:12.500 --> 00:23:14.300 line:0%
that we haven't discovered yet.

00:23:16.360 --> 00:23:17.160 line:0%
Well.

00:23:17.590 --> 00:23:19.590 line:0%
I need to go to Chen's Mansion again.

00:24:40.570 --> 00:24:41.550 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:24:44.640 --> 00:24:45.570 line:0%
Are you alright?

00:24:47.200 --> 00:24:48.160 line:0%
Be careful!

00:25:18.580 --> 00:25:21.010 line:0%
Although the design of the hidden weapon is different from that day's,

00:25:21.010 --> 00:25:22.250 line:0%
the ways they're used

00:25:22.320 --> 00:25:23.600 line:0%
are very similar.

00:25:28.040 --> 00:25:29.080 line:0%
You're hurt.

00:25:29.760 --> 00:25:30.560 line:0%
It's nothing.

00:25:31.320 --> 00:25:32.380 line:0%
Just a minor wound.

00:25:35.360 --> 00:25:36.890 line:0%
Why did you come here alone?

00:25:37.600 --> 00:25:40.200 line:0%
I came to look for someone but I didn't find him.

00:25:42.430 --> 00:25:43.640 line:0%
You're bleeding so much.

00:25:43.640 --> 00:25:45.370 line:0%
How could you possibly be fine?

00:25:53.680 --> 00:25:55.120 line:0%
Are you worried about me?

00:26:06.800 --> 00:26:08.600 line:0%
I'm not worried about you at all.

00:26:13.250 --> 00:26:15.600 line:0%
You got hurt trying to save me.

00:26:18.650 --> 00:26:21.180 line:0%
I should at least take responsibility for it.

00:26:49.870 --> 00:26:51.990 line:0%
Father is really annoying.

00:26:52.030 --> 00:26:54.160 line:0%
The shop was properly closed.

00:26:54.240 --> 00:26:55.120 line:0%
Yet he still insisted me going there

00:26:55.120 --> 00:26:57.050 line:0%
to check if there's been any theft.

00:26:59.260 --> 00:27:00.770 line:0%
Want to run?

00:27:05.660 --> 00:27:08.210 line:0%
I advise you not to make another mistake.

00:27:08.390 --> 00:27:10.800 line:0%
I am a female official from the Ministry of Justice.

00:27:10.800 --> 00:27:12.720 line:0%
If you go to the government and report your crime voluntarily,

00:27:12.720 --> 00:27:14.720 line:0%
you might be given a lighter sentence for your theft.

00:27:14.720 --> 00:27:16.240 line:0%
But if you harm me,

00:27:16.440 --> 00:27:18.240 line:0%
that would be a serious offense.

00:27:18.400 --> 00:27:20.200 line:0%
You nosy woman.

00:27:20.400 --> 00:27:21.530 line:0%
Go to hell!

00:27:21.640 --> 00:27:22.840 line:0%
Help!

00:27:37.740 --> 00:27:39.000 line:0%
It's you.

00:27:39.000 --> 00:27:39.800 line:0%
Who's there?

00:27:50.280 --> 00:27:51.080 line:0%
Wait.

00:27:51.080 --> 00:27:51.920 line:0%
Wait a moment.

00:27:52.040 --> 00:27:52.840 line:0%
Wait.

00:27:54.200 --> 00:27:55.000 line:0%
Just now,

00:27:55.400 --> 00:27:56.860 line:0%
those who were patrolling

00:27:56.920 --> 00:27:58.090 line:0%
are constables.

00:27:58.270 --> 00:27:59.710 line:0%
Why did we have to hide?

00:28:05.640 --> 00:28:06.440 line:0%
I

00:28:07.240 --> 00:28:09.840 line:0%
don't want to deal with government officials.

00:28:11.640 --> 00:28:12.360 line:0%
You avoid

00:28:12.360 --> 00:28:14.420 line:0%
dealing with government officials,

00:28:15.600 --> 00:28:17.730 line:0%
yet you're so skilled in martial arts.

00:28:23.480 --> 00:28:25.930 line:0%
I know your identity now.

00:28:29.200 --> 00:28:30.260 line:0%
You are

00:28:32.730 --> 00:28:35.530 line:0%
a chivalrous hero who likes to help others, right?

00:28:38.400 --> 00:28:40.090 line:0%
You're one of those who will put on a mask at night

00:28:40.090 --> 00:28:42.060 line:0%
and transform into a righteous warrior,

00:28:42.060 --> 00:28:43.450 line:0%
fighting for justice,

00:28:43.900 --> 00:28:45.830 line:0%
and doing good deeds anonymously.

00:28:46.490 --> 00:28:47.330 line:0%
I suppose so.

00:28:50.100 --> 00:28:51.140 line:0%
Wait a moment.

00:28:51.440 --> 00:28:52.370 line:0%
You can't leave.

00:28:52.410 --> 00:28:53.710 line:0%
You killed someone.

00:28:54.440 --> 00:28:55.240 line:0%
So what?

00:28:56.200 --> 00:28:58.730 line:0%
Are you going to turn me in to the authorities?

00:28:58.960 --> 00:29:00.640 line:0%
The person I killed was trying to kill you.

00:29:00.640 --> 00:29:01.520 line:0%
Is this how you treat

00:29:01.520 --> 00:29:03.040 line:0%
someone who saved your life?

00:29:03.040 --> 00:29:04.320 line:0%
According to the law of Cang State,

00:29:04.320 --> 00:29:05.960 line:0%
if someone tries to attack you without reason at night

00:29:05.960 --> 00:29:08.360 line:0%
and you resist the attacker and accidentally kill them,

00:29:08.360 --> 00:29:09.680 line:0%
you won't be punished.

00:29:10.120 --> 00:29:11.160 line:0%
However,

00:29:11.360 --> 00:29:12.080 line:0%
you can't just

00:29:12.080 --> 00:29:13.560 line:0%
go away like this.

00:29:21.120 --> 00:29:22.240 line:0%
What are you doing?

00:29:22.960 --> 00:29:25.090 line:0%
I'm releasing a water lantern for you.

00:29:36.040 --> 00:29:37.210 line:0%
When I was little,

00:29:37.530 --> 00:29:38.540 line:0%
my mother

00:29:38.560 --> 00:29:41.280 line:0%
often brought me here to release water lanterns.

00:29:41.280 --> 00:29:42.560 line:0%
Mother said

00:29:42.960 --> 00:29:46.400 line:0%
the water lanterns could float away with the current,

00:29:46.770 --> 00:29:48.610 line:0%
dispelling disasters and illnesses,

00:29:48.610 --> 00:29:49.650 line:0%
and could also

00:29:49.720 --> 00:29:50.960 line:0%
remove all the bad things

00:29:50.960 --> 00:29:52.080 line:0%
from our bodies.

00:29:57.700 --> 00:29:59.630 line:0%
Although you killed him to save me,

00:29:59.900 --> 00:30:01.180 line:0%
I still think

00:30:02.280 --> 00:30:03.460 line:0%
I should release a water lantern for you

00:30:03.460 --> 00:30:05.260 line:0%
to cleanse the karma of killing.

00:30:06.170 --> 00:30:06.970 line:0%
No need.

00:30:07.770 --> 00:30:09.330 line:0%
I don't believe in such things.

00:30:09.330 --> 00:30:11.480 line:0%
If you believe, it will work.

00:30:12.320 --> 00:30:14.440 line:0%
I didn't believe it when I was young either,

00:30:14.440 --> 00:30:16.370 line:0%
so I released them halfheartedly.

00:30:16.720 --> 00:30:17.810 line:0%
Later,

00:30:18.360 --> 00:30:20.620 line:0%
my mother's illness got worse and worse,

00:30:21.000 --> 00:30:22.080 line:0%
and she left me.

00:30:24.240 --> 00:30:25.740 line:0%
I often wonder

00:30:26.200 --> 00:30:27.620 line:0%
if back then,

00:30:27.730 --> 00:30:29.570 line:0%
I had sincerely

00:30:29.600 --> 00:30:31.330 line:0%
released every water lantern,

00:30:34.380 --> 00:30:35.970 line:0%
would the gods

00:30:36.400 --> 00:30:38.050 line:0%
have granted my wish

00:30:38.210 --> 00:30:41.450 line:0%
and let my mother stay with me forever.

00:30:51.800 --> 00:30:55.390 line:0%
Even if you release thousands or tens of thousands of water lanterns,

00:30:55.390 --> 00:30:57.920 line:0%
those who are meant to leave will still leave.

00:30:59.420 --> 00:31:00.870 line:0%
In this life,

00:31:01.640 --> 00:31:02.960 line:0%
they have already decided

00:31:02.960 --> 00:31:05.020 line:0%
to accompany us for only one journey.

00:31:07.280 --> 00:31:08.440 line:0%
It can't be changed.

00:31:12.300 --> 00:31:13.850 line:0%
Nothing can be changed.

00:31:16.210 --> 00:31:16.870 line:0%
Ghost Face.

00:31:40.720 --> 00:31:41.720 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:31:41.720 --> 00:31:43.160 line:0%
The criminal hung himself in a deep alley.

00:31:43.160 --> 00:31:44.620 line:0%
We couldn't identify him.

00:31:44.970 --> 00:31:46.380 line:0%
He hung himself?

00:31:48.320 --> 00:31:49.700 line:0%
If he planned to kill himself once found,

00:31:49.700 --> 00:31:50.640 line:0%
they wouldn't let us

00:31:50.640 --> 00:31:51.840 line:0%
identify him.

00:31:52.320 --> 00:31:53.120 line:0%
You may go.

00:31:54.200 --> 00:31:54.640 line:0%
Yes.

00:31:59.360 --> 00:32:00.360 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:32:00.480 --> 00:32:02.040 line:0%
Do you really not need me to call a doctor to check on you?

00:32:02.040 --> 00:32:02.840 line:0%
No need for ointment?

00:32:02.840 --> 00:32:04.170 line:0%
Mind your own business.

00:32:04.800 --> 00:32:05.930 line:0%
It's not necessary.

00:32:05.940 --> 00:32:07.540 line:0%
Who said it's not necessary?

00:32:11.320 --> 00:32:13.120 line:0%
Let me apply the ointment on you.

00:32:47.050 --> 00:32:49.110 line:0%
Do you have anything else to do later?

00:32:52.620 --> 00:32:54.380 line:0%
You seem to be in a hurry.

00:32:55.180 --> 00:32:57.650 line:0%
Surely you're not rushing off to rest, are you?

00:32:57.650 --> 00:32:59.100 line:0%
Of course not.

00:33:00.640 --> 00:33:02.180 line:0%
I was thinking...

00:33:03.010 --> 00:33:04.320 line:0%
If I finish treating your wounds

00:33:04.320 --> 00:33:05.650 line:0%
and it's not too late,

00:33:06.210 --> 00:33:07.520 line:0%
I could still go to the Ministry of Justice

00:33:07.520 --> 00:33:09.050 line:0%
to work on the case.

00:33:13.840 --> 00:33:15.080 line:0%
The work is so urgent

00:33:15.610 --> 00:33:17.470 line:0%
that you can't even rest at night?

00:33:17.890 --> 00:33:19.320 line:0%
Well, I just want to

00:33:19.320 --> 00:33:20.780 line:0%
solve the case sooner.

00:33:20.990 --> 00:33:22.920 line:0%
Staying up all night is no big deal.

00:33:30.200 --> 00:33:31.520 line:0%
But I'm injured.

00:33:32.750 --> 00:33:33.970 line:0%
Don't you think

00:33:35.010 --> 00:33:37.410 line:0%
you should stay and take care of me tonight?

00:33:40.880 --> 00:33:42.470 line:0%
I...

00:33:44.340 --> 00:33:45.140 line:0%
Never mind.

00:33:48.260 --> 00:33:50.120 line:0%
I don't need you to take care of me.

00:33:50.720 --> 00:33:52.050 line:0%
Go ahead with your work.

00:33:52.160 --> 00:33:53.350 line:0%
Fine, I'll stay.

00:33:53.470 --> 00:33:54.950 line:0%
Who said I was leaving?

00:33:56.800 --> 00:33:59.020 line:0%
You got hurt when you were saving me.

00:33:59.160 --> 00:34:00.440 line:0%
If I were to leave now,

00:34:00.440 --> 00:34:01.520 line:0%
even the gods would think

00:34:01.520 --> 00:34:02.440 line:0%
I have no conscience.

00:34:02.440 --> 00:34:03.080 line:0%
If the gods send

00:34:03.080 --> 00:34:04.000 line:0%
lightning to strike me down for it,

00:34:04.000 --> 00:34:05.600 line:0%
that would be so unfair to me.

00:34:17.620 --> 00:34:21.810 line:0%
♫The night is still young, and the moonlight reflects on the west window♫

00:34:22.760 --> 00:34:25.789 line:0%
♫There are stars in your eyes♫

00:34:26.510 --> 00:34:27.900 line:0%
♫When I touch you♫

00:34:28.729 --> 00:34:32.030 line:0%
♫My heart is like a flickering candlelight, shaking and swaying♫

00:34:33.080 --> 00:34:37.450 line:0%
♫The more I care, the deeper I hide♫

00:34:38.700 --> 00:34:43.220 line:0%
♫Leaves turn yellow and fall, and my thoughts run in thousands of lines♫

00:34:44.090 --> 00:34:47.200 line:0%
♫Time is like a poem, romantic and sorrowful♫

00:34:47.729 --> 00:34:49.470 line:0%
♫Two hearts♫

00:34:50.180 --> 00:34:53.420 line:0%
♫Collide between dawn and dusk♫

00:34:54.019 --> 00:34:58.050 line:0%
♫The embrace came as a surprise♫

00:34:59.270 --> 00:35:02.050 line:0%
♫I want to be with you, side by side♫

00:35:02.380 --> 00:35:05.800 line:0%
♫I want to keep you by my side♫

00:35:06.240 --> 00:35:09.900 line:0%
♫Through the obstacle of wind and rain♫

00:35:10.420 --> 00:35:12.790 line:0%
♫I want to be your moonlight♫

00:35:12.600 --> 00:35:14.240 line:0%
I think you just pressed my wound.

00:35:13.280 --> 00:35:16.670 line:0%
♫Accompany you until every dawn♫

00:35:16.930 --> 00:35:19.140 line:0%
♫How I wish♫

00:35:19.750 --> 00:35:23.180 line:0%
♫I could just forget the passage of time like this♫

00:35:23.830 --> 00:35:26.350 line:0%
♫I want to be with you, side by side♫

00:35:26.610 --> 00:35:30.110 line:0%
♫May we never forget each other♫

00:35:29.440 --> 00:35:30.640 line:0%
Don't be distracted.

00:35:30.690 --> 00:35:33.890 line:0%
♫There will always be a place for us to meet♫

00:35:31.400 --> 00:35:32.860 line:0%
Dress my wound carefully.

00:35:33.450 --> 00:35:34.290 line:0%
Okay, okay.

00:35:34.310 --> 00:35:36.950 line:0%
♫I want to be with you, side by side♫

00:35:37.510 --> 00:35:40.510 line:0%
♫I want to keep you by my side♫

00:35:41.040 --> 00:35:44.480 line:0%
♫Through the obstacle of wind and rain♫

00:35:43.560 --> 00:35:44.360 line:0%
Maybe it's because just now

00:35:44.360 --> 00:35:46.120 line:0%
I didn't dress it well enough.

00:35:45.080 --> 00:35:47.470 line:0%
♫I want to be your moonlight♫

00:35:46.930 --> 00:35:47.930 line:0%
Now it's all good.

00:35:48.150 --> 00:35:51.170 line:0%
♫Accompany you until every dawn♫

00:35:51.450 --> 00:35:53.880 line:0%
♫How I wish♫

00:35:51.760 --> 00:35:52.600 line:0%
It's getting late.

00:35:52.600 --> 00:35:54.040 line:0%
You should rest early.

00:35:54.470 --> 00:35:57.550 line:0%
♫I could just forget the passage of time like this♫

00:35:58.530 --> 00:36:01.180 line:0%
♫I want to be with you, side by side♫

00:36:02.330 --> 00:36:04.750 line:0%
♫May we never forget each other♫

00:36:05.480 --> 00:36:08.870 line:0%
♫There will always be a place for us to meet♫

00:36:09.400 --> 00:36:11.660 line:0%
♫I want to be with you forever♫

00:36:12.280 --> 00:36:15.610 line:0%
♫When our black hair turns grey♫

00:36:16.000 --> 00:36:18.040 line:0%
♫In this life♫

00:36:18.810 --> 00:36:22.680 line:0%
♫I'll only cherish you in my heart♫

00:36:38.370 --> 00:36:39.050 line:0%
My Lord.

00:36:41.880 --> 00:36:42.890 line:0%
My Lord, please don't kill me.

00:36:42.890 --> 00:36:44.010 line:0%
I've got the news

00:36:44.040 --> 00:36:44.980 line:0%
that the constables

00:36:44.980 --> 00:36:46.320 line:0%
have handled the case as a common one of thieves

00:36:46.320 --> 00:36:46.920 line:0%
fighting among themselves.

00:36:46.920 --> 00:36:48.520 line:0%
It's reported to the Ministry of Justice.

00:36:48.520 --> 00:36:49.280 line:0%
Useless!

00:36:49.280 --> 00:36:51.600 line:0%
Send more competent people to handle this.

00:36:51.600 --> 00:36:53.110 line:0%
If there's anything that goes wrong again,

00:36:53.110 --> 00:36:55.030 line:0%
You'll be the next to die.

00:36:55.520 --> 00:36:56.440 line:0%
Got it.

00:36:56.440 --> 00:36:58.500 line:0%
Thank you for not killing me, My Lord.

00:37:02.020 --> 00:37:04.680 line:0%
As for Lu Chuichui from the Ministry of Justice,

00:37:05.130 --> 00:37:06.590 line:0%
don't let anyone hurt her.

00:37:07.090 --> 00:37:07.890 line:0%
Understood.

00:37:11.810 --> 00:37:12.810 line:0%
You may leave now.

00:37:16.720 --> 00:37:19.620 line:0%
These ignorant fools.

00:37:20.890 --> 00:37:22.920 line:0%
A mere fire moth trick

00:37:22.920 --> 00:37:25.040 line:0%
can turn everything upside down.

00:37:25.520 --> 00:37:27.540 line:0%
It won't be long

00:37:28.010 --> 00:37:29.700 line:0%
before Cang State...

00:37:42.760 --> 00:37:44.200 line:0%
Get up first.

00:37:44.240 --> 00:37:46.370 line:0%
Go to the front hall and eat something.

00:37:46.440 --> 00:37:47.280 line:0%
When someone is injured,

00:37:47.280 --> 00:37:48.720 line:0%
they should eat more.

00:38:04.440 --> 00:38:05.480 line:0%
As you can see,

00:38:06.560 --> 00:38:08.170 line:0%
I'm severely injured now.

00:38:08.280 --> 00:38:09.940 line:0%
It's difficult for me to move.

00:38:12.800 --> 00:38:15.200 line:0%
Going to the front hall is too much trouble.

00:38:15.260 --> 00:38:16.600 line:0%
I just want to lie down.

00:38:19.430 --> 00:38:20.230 line:0%
Alright.

00:38:20.380 --> 00:38:21.640 line:0%
Then you rest well.

00:38:21.640 --> 00:38:22.400 line:0%
I'll

00:38:22.400 --> 00:38:24.260 line:0%
bring your breakfast here later.

00:39:19.400 --> 00:39:20.200 line:0%
Well.

00:39:23.380 --> 00:39:24.400 line:0%
Where's my wife?

00:39:24.600 --> 00:39:25.740 line:0%
Someone from Yan's Mansion came.

00:39:25.740 --> 00:39:27.290 line:0%
They invited Madam to their banquet.

00:39:27.290 --> 00:39:29.250 line:0%
She said that since are seriously injured,

00:39:29.250 --> 00:39:30.640 line:0%
you don't need to attend the banquet with her.

00:39:30.640 --> 00:39:31.040 line:0%
I...

00:39:31.040 --> 00:39:33.370 line:0%
She asked us to serve you well at mealtime.

00:39:46.080 --> 00:39:46.880 line:0%
You may go now.

00:39:47.560 --> 00:39:48.360 line:0%
Yes.

00:40:16.240 --> 00:40:17.500 line:0%
Grand Commander, I...

00:40:19.760 --> 00:40:21.120 line:0%
What is it?

00:40:23.040 --> 00:40:24.320 line:0%
I've found new information.

00:40:24.320 --> 00:40:25.360 line:0%
Han Shiyuan

00:40:25.760 --> 00:40:27.020 line:0%
is no ordinary person.

00:40:29.200 --> 00:40:32.160 line:0%
[Full of Nature Bestows]

00:40:34.520 --> 00:40:35.510 line:0%
Xing.

00:40:35.530 --> 00:40:36.520 line:0%
Shiyuan and I

00:40:36.520 --> 00:40:38.720 line:0%
will hold our wedding in the next month.

00:40:40.400 --> 00:40:42.120 line:0%
I'd like to use tea instead of wine

00:40:42.120 --> 00:40:44.080 line:0%
to toast to Sister Caiwei and Mr. Han.

00:40:44.080 --> 00:40:45.940 line:0%
May you be a happy couple forever.

00:40:46.620 --> 00:40:48.040 line:0%
I apologize for my impatience earlier

00:40:48.040 --> 00:40:49.260 line:0%
and any lack of proper etiquette.

00:40:49.260 --> 00:40:50.480 line:0%
Please forgive me.

00:40:50.960 --> 00:40:52.080 line:0%
Never mind.

00:40:57.000 --> 00:40:58.040 line:0%
Alright.

00:40:58.040 --> 00:40:59.360 line:0%
Take your seat.

00:40:59.820 --> 00:41:01.360 line:0%
Our Yan family this year

00:41:01.360 --> 00:41:03.060 line:0%
has one joyous event after another.

00:41:03.060 --> 00:41:05.130 line:0%
Mojie has been admitted to the Hongwen Academy.

00:41:05.130 --> 00:41:06.810 line:0%
Xing and Caiwei

00:41:06.850 --> 00:41:09.010 line:0%
found good husbands.

00:41:11.040 --> 00:41:11.840 line:0%
Xing.

00:41:12.040 --> 00:41:14.240 line:0%
Why did you come back frequently lately?

00:41:14.240 --> 00:41:15.200 line:0%
Are you and Grand Commander

00:41:15.200 --> 00:41:16.320 line:0%
not getting along?

00:41:16.730 --> 00:41:17.690 line:0%
No, no,

00:41:17.710 --> 00:41:19.480 line:0%
I'm doing well at Shen's Mansion.

00:41:19.480 --> 00:41:20.760 line:0%
It's just that a few days ago,

00:41:20.760 --> 00:41:21.750 line:0%
the cook

00:41:21.880 --> 00:41:23.480 line:0%
took a few days off to go home.

00:41:23.560 --> 00:41:25.000 line:0%
So the food there wasn't quite to my taste recently.

00:41:25.000 --> 00:41:26.660 line:0%
Then I came home for nice food.

00:41:27.760 --> 00:41:29.090 line:0%
Well, that's good then.

00:41:29.440 --> 00:41:30.480 line:0%
There are rumors out there,

00:41:30.480 --> 00:41:31.760 line:0%
saying that every time you come back here,

00:41:31.760 --> 00:41:33.400 line:0%
Grand Commander will come to take you away.

00:41:33.400 --> 00:41:34.440 line:0%
That's

00:41:34.440 --> 00:41:35.500 line:0%
a bit frightening.

00:41:35.720 --> 00:41:37.160 line:0%
But the last time you came home,

00:41:37.160 --> 00:41:38.770 line:0%
he didn't come to take you away.

00:41:38.770 --> 00:41:41.410 line:0%
And I was feeling uneasy about it.

00:41:49.080 --> 00:41:50.080 line:0%
Master, Madam.

00:41:50.080 --> 00:41:51.740 line:0%
The grand commander has come.

00:42:02.280 --> 00:42:03.280 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:42:08.720 --> 00:42:11.380 line:0%
Grand Commander, please take the seat of honor.

00:42:15.080 --> 00:42:18.270 line:0%
Aren't you having difficulty moving?

00:42:22.640 --> 00:42:24.120 line:0%
It's my father-in-law's family dinner.

00:42:24.120 --> 00:42:25.180 line:0%
I couldn't miss it.

00:42:28.040 --> 00:42:28.960 line:0%
Yes, indeed, indeed.

00:42:28.960 --> 00:42:29.680 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:42:29.680 --> 00:42:30.880 line:0%
Please, come in.